@startuml AD-03-job-rejection
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor white
 BorderColor black
 DiamondBackgroundColor white
 DiamondBorderColor black
 StartColor black
 EndColor black
}
skinparam swimlaneBorderColor black
skinparam swimlaneTitleFontStyle bold
skinparam conditionStyle InsideDiamond
skinparam wrapWidth 145
skinparam dpi 180
title AD-03: Job Rejection and Subsequent Reassignment
' Traces: UC-12 A3, UC-09 A3, UC-07, UC-13, UC-15; FR-41/44/45/46/62/63/64; NFR-09.
' Sources: DEC-10, DEC-16, DEC-19, DEC-42, DEC-43, DEC-46.
' User choices 2026-10-03: Short notice <48 h; exactly 48 h normal; SMS; lapse has status updates only.
|Staff|
start
:Select Job; read warning;
if (Proceed?) then (yes)
  :Enter reason / explanation;
else (cancel)
  stop
endif
|System|
:Save valid Pending request\n(UC-12);
fork
  |System|
  :Wait until Job start;
  if (Still Pending?) then (yes)
    :Set Lapsed;
  else (no)
    :End timer;
    end
  endif
fork again
  |Manager|
  :Review and choose\nApprove or Refuse (UC-09);
  |System|
  :Atomically save decision;\nif Approved, unassign Job;
  if (Decision saved?) then (yes)
  else (no)
    :Show error / current status;
    end
  endif
end merge
|System|
if (Outcome?) then (Approved)
  :Update Workload;\nnotify affected Staff;
  |Manager|
  if (Reallocate now?) then (later)
    |System|
    :Keep Job Unassigned;
  else (yes)
    |Manager|
    :Choose Van-day, Crew\nand start (UC-07);
    |System|
    :Validate and reassign;\nnotify Staff;
  endif
else (Refused / Lapsed)
  |System|
  :Keep Assignment;\nnotify if Refused;
endif
|Staff|
:View outcome and\ncurrent Assignment (UC-13);
stop
legend bottom
Own Published Assigned Job only. Other needs a comment; less than 48 h needs an explanation.
Decision save requires Pending and before Job start; lapse competes atomically.
No Pending request until saved. Save failures: 3 retries, then retry / contact IT Administrator.
Update Staff / Manager views on lapse. Notifications: Landing Page, email and SMS.
endlegend

@enduml
